window.MC_CONTENT_EXTRA.push({"a":"sion","b":"zaahen","win":["Skill","Zaahen","Zaahen","Skill","Skill","Zaahen","Zaahen"],"spikes":[{"when":"Zaahen level 2","text":"His Q recast knocks you up; the wind-up is the tell, not the cast — charge Q smarter."},{"when":"Levels 4-5","text":"The lane calms down; farm safely and stack HP — he cannot stop a patient Sion."},{"when":"Zaahen first item","text":"The Darkin Glaive heals him twice a trade — buy Grievous Wounds or stop contesting."},{"when":"Grouped fights","text":"Your R engage and teamfight CC matter far more than the sidelane he wins."}],"wants":{"you":["Safe farm behind Q threat","R engages that start 5v4 fights","Cross-map pressure over 1v1 pride"],"foe":["Trades taken whenever your Q is down","Sidelane duels from first item on","Your engage answered before the team arrives"]},"early":"Level 1 is a farming check, then he takes over the trade game: from 2 his Q auto-reset slashes twice and heals him, and by 3 the Aureate Rush dash adds percent-health damage that armour does not answer. Charge Q defensively, concede the trades he forces, and use 4-5's calm to bank waves safely.","mid":"At 6 the lane stays a wash — your R is an engage tool, not a duel button, so nothing changes 1v1. His first item widens his trade lead with Q damage and passive healing, so stop contesting entirely: shove with E, roam with your R, and turn his lane win into your map win.","late":"He wins the sidelane 1v1 from here, so never offer it. His passive revives him at full Determination, so a won duel is not always a kill. You are an engage tank with a cross-map ult: R into the carry line, follow with the charged Q knockup, and let your team fight 5v4. He can have the sidelane.","whys":["Level 1 is a skill check with just last-hitting and no kill threat either way.","Level 2 is his: his Q auto-reset slashes twice and heals, so trade only after it.","Level 3 stays his: Aureate Rush dashes in every 10s for percent HP.","Levels 4-5 read even — you farm safely and he has no clean duel threat.","Level 6 is a wash 1v1 — save R to answer his dash, not to duel him.","At first item his Q heal beats your farm — Grievous Wounds, not more armour.","With 2+ items he wins the sidelane 1v1 against a non-duelist engage tank — group instead."]});
