window.MC_CONTENT_EXTRA.push({"a":"sion","b":"masteryi","win":["Sion","Sion","Sion","Sion","Master Yi","Master Yi","Sion"],"spikes":[{"when":"Level 1","text":"Charged Q stun plus your passive shield crush his opening trades."},{"when":"Levels 4-5","text":"Charge poke and durability still beat his early DPS — keep denying farm."},{"when":"Yi level 6","text":"Highlander out-DPSes you before armor stacks — the danger window opens."},{"when":"Your two-plus items","text":"Health and R engage out-tank him — his true damage laughs at armour."}],"wants":{"you":["Farm denial through the early levels","Armor stacked before his spike matures","Fights started by your R, not his"],"foe":["A quiet lane into Highlander","Duels during your mid-game armor gap","Resets found before your team reacts"]},"early":"The first four stages are a stomp: the charged Q stun and W-shield crush his level-1 trades, Q burst and E shove deny his farm at 2, and your durability beats his item-less DPS through 5. Do not release a charge into Alpha Strike — he is untargetable for it, and it is 20s at rank 1. Starve him now.","mid":"At 6 and his first item the matchup dips: Highlander is 85s of speed and slow immunity, so neither your Q slow nor your E slow touches him while it runs. Buy Grievous Wounds — Meditate is a 10s heal channel your stun cancels outright. Otherwise shove with E and spend the window engaging for your team with R.","late":"At two-plus items the wall is finished — but build it from health: Wuju Style is true damage, so armour does nothing against it. Your R engage dictates the fights and the zombie passive keeps hitting him after death. Knock him up mid-reset with the charged Q and let your team erase him inside the CC.","whys":["Your charged Q stun and passive shield crush his level-1 trades.","At 2 your Q burst and E shove keep denying his farm.","Level 3 you still out-trade his item-less kit with Q and the shield.","Through 4-5 your charge poke and durability beat his early DPS.","At 6 Highlander gives speed and slow immunity on an 85s cooldown — his window.","At first item he out-duels you, and Meditate heals it back without Grievous Wounds.","At 2+ items your HP pool and R engage win — Wuju Style is true damage, buy health not armour."]});
